        "StatPearls – Microneedling: <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK459344/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK459344/</a>",
        "StatPearls – Laser Therapy in Dermatology: <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/</a>",
